<title>JAPAN: New Japan Chemical - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>New Japan Chemical - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 11.61		vs	   12.80</p>
<p> Operating   loss 422 million	 vs	prft 112 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 377 million	 vs	prft 212 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 373 million	 vs	prft 204 million</p>
<p> EPS	     loss 9.81 yen	  vs     prft 5.38 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     38 million	  vs	  38 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - New Japan Chemical Co Ltd makes oils and fats, plasticisers and chemical products.</p>
